The yaungol are our enemies.

Still, we must prove we are better than they. We will show them honor in death.

As after most battles, the carrion birds have begun gathering. Thin their numbers, so the bodies of our foes will not be desecrated. They''ve gathered at the battlefield to the west.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Return to Lin Silentstrike at Winter''s Blossom in Kun-Lai Summit.', 19034), -- Honor, Even in Death
