If you defeat the spirits in battle, you can collect essence from the spirits as dust, and then return it to the corpses in the area, which will send the spirits, finally, to the next life.

This is the only way to set right what the Deadtalkers have done. It will also help keep us safe.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Speak to your Shado-Pan companion in the field or return to Master Snowdrift at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.', 19034), -- Spirit Dust
