UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AllowableRaces`=-1, `QuestDescription`='$n, there''s a new threat in Elwynn Forest!  Murlocs are swimming up the streams of eastern Elwynn, scaring away fish and attacking gentle folk!$B$BI warned Marshal Dughan, but he''s more worried about the gnolls and the bandits.  He''s not convinced that the murlocs are a danger.$B$BPlease, $n, speak to Dughan and persuade him to send more troops to the east!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=40; -- A Fishy Peril
