UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=51900, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=12113; -- Nice to Meat You
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=16500, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='$n, you must travel as swiftly as you can to Wyrmrest Temple and present this letter to the steward, Tariolstrasz.$B$BThe temple sits in the center of the Dragonblight. Follow the road east until it ends, and then cross The Dragon Wastes to get to it.$B$BI''m sure that when the steward reads your introduction, he''ll see to it that you gain an audience with Queen Alexstrasza. We can only hope that we''re not too late.$B$BThank you for all that you have done on our behalf. Safe journeys!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=12119; -- Gaining an Audience
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=16500, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='$n, you must travel as swiftly as you can to Wyrmrest Temple and present this letter to the steward, Tariolstrasz.$B$BThe temple sits in the center of the Dragonblight. Follow the road east until it ends, and then cross The Dragon Wastes to get to it.$B$BI''m sure that when the steward reads your introduction, he''ll see to it that you gain an audience with Queen Alexstrasza. We can only hope that we''re not too late.$B$BThank you for all that you have done on our behalf. Safe journeys!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=12122; -- Gaining an Audience
