UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=17400, `QuestDescription`='Crusader Dargath, Crusader MacKellar, Engineer Reed and the twins, Gerk and Burr, were sent to the Dead Fields to establish a battle front days ago. As of my last correspondence with them, they had successfully established a camp on the border of the Dead Fields, northwest of here.$B$BIn light of this newfound information about Drakuru and Prince Navarius I think it would be prudent to send someone to the Crusader Forward Camp post-haste.$B$BPack up your belongings, $n. You must leave at once!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=12894; -- Crusader Forward Camp
