UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=2, `RewardBonusMoney`=19200, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='I can''t believe it, $n. Me own son - me own flesh and blood! Throwing his lot in with those fiends from the Twilight''s Hammer. Did you see what he became when he tried to destroy the wedding? Oh ... why? Why?$B$BIt''s that beast, $n. The enormous mouth emerging from the earth to our west. "The Maw of Madness!" My son said it spoke to him, but I thought it was just nightmares.$B$BThe Earthen Ring is trying to destroy it. Go to Earthcaller Torunscar, west of here, and see how you can help!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=27374; -- The Maw of Madness
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=2, `RewardBonusMoney`=19200, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='A beast, $n! I saw a beast. A great maw, an even greater hungering. They can''t possibly know what they unleashed.$B$BIt is here. Its terrible shapeless body is erupting right into the Highlands.$B$BI saw you in my vision, $n. You struggle with the Earthen Ring to contain the beast. You will face the darkness.$B$BGo now, before the beast grows in power. Speak to Earthcaller Torunscar at the Circle of the Elements, northwest of here atop the ridge beyond the ruined Drakgor Encampment. Hurry!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=27375; -- The Weeping Wound
