UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=2, `AllowableRaces`=-2, `QuestDescription`='I have here an urgent message from Sergeant Willem. Turns out that the Blackrock orcs have hired goblin assassins. They ambushed our battalion behind the abbey. Willem has asked me to send him a hero. You have to go help them, $n!$B$BFind Sergeant Willem north of the abbey at the command tent. Go!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29080; -- Join the Battle!
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=-2, `QuestDescription`='Have you ever seen a goblin, $n? They''re wretched little green-skinned monsters that love only two things: gold and themselves.$B$BThe Blackrock orcs have enlisted the aid of goblin assassins to kill our soldiers. If you look to the field in the north you can barely make out their silhouettes, sneaking about in the grass.$B$BI need you to head out there and kill every goblin that you see. They need to learn that nobody messes with the Alliance!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29081; -- They Sent Assassins
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=-2, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29082; -- Fear No Evil
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=1, `Flags`=786432, `AllowableRaces`=-2, `QuestDescription`='Excellent work, $n! The rear is now officially clear. We''ll take care of the stragglers. I want you to go back to Marshal McBride, standing in front of Northshire Abbey, south of here, and let him know that the goblin situation is under control.$B$BFarewell, $c.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29083; -- The Rear is Clear
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='Hey $n, do you see this footprint? We found them all over the camp last night! Nothing''s missing, but all our belongings have been...examined. The muddy trails lead back toward the Sludge Fen.$B$BSomeone''s been sniffing around, and I don''t like it one bit. Can you go west to the Sludge Fen and investigate? See if you can find any more tracks just like this one!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29087; -- Sludge Investigation
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='Hey $n, we''ve got a real problem here. There''s an overpopulation of hyenas just west of the Sludge Fen, and they''re starting to become a menace.$B$BIf I have to listen to them caterwauling one more night, I just might go crazy! Vernon over there says the hyenas might even have made off with one of his stabled pigs. We can''t have that happening.$B$BCan you go thin out the hyena numbers? You''ll find them parading in broad daylight to the west.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29088; -- Hyena Extermination
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='While we cast our eyes toward the cataclysm, who watches our backs? While our leaders take up arms against Deathwing, the Burning Blade plots our downfall.$B$BEven as we speak, they are gathering recruits and supplies at the farm to the southwest. I care not to meet death at the hands of the Burning Legion. It''s time we take matters into our own hands.$B$B$n, will you help me keep the vigil? Go and slaughter their ranks before it''s too late.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29090; -- A Burning Threat
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=57900, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Baby turtles are sweet, even if they can be somewhat bitey.$b$b<Mylune holds up a bandaged finger.>$B$BBut they''re so slow with their tiny little legs, they can''t escape the fire creatures who are attacking Hyjal!$b$b<Mylune claps her hands together.>$b$bPLEASE save them, $n! Pick up the wee turtles and punt them into the water of the Ashen Lake. Don''t worry about the kicking, they have hard shells.$B$BThey also have hard teeth, so don''t pick them up by the mouth.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29101; -- Punting Season
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=7500, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29109; -- Mor'shan Caravan Pick-Up
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='They took Balgor and the caravan supplies from our very doorstep!$B$BThose supplies are vital for our victory against the Alliance in Ashenvale, and Balgor...if anything happens to my dear little brother, I will rip every Burning Blade member to shreds myself.$B$B$n, I need you to rescue Balgor and the captured caravan. Follow the path just north of us, up onto Dreadmist Peak. Do not let any of those Burning Blade dogs live.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29110; -- Mor'shan Caravan Rescue
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Listen $n, we can''t leave quite yet. I managed to overhear their plans while they were preparing for the ritual sacrifice.$B$BThey''re planning to use a powerful artifact called the Demon Seed to launch a full scale attack on the Horde. They''re keeping it under close guard over in that cave.$B$BIf you can get your hands on the Demon Seed, we should take it to my sister Nagala. She''ll know what to do with it.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29112; -- Demon Seed
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=57900, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29125 /*Between the Trees*/, 29147 /*Call the Flock*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='The Druids of the Flame assault our front line, $n.$B$BThese vile creatures have turned their backs on Elune''s teachings and worship instead the Fire Lord, Ragnaros. Twisted by his insane power, they desire nothing more than to bury us in ash.$B$BWe must counter their attack immediately!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29142; -- Traitors Return
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=1, `RewardBonusMoney`=7800, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29156; -- The Troll Incursion
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=1, `RewardBonusMoney`=7800, `Flags`=262272, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29157; -- The Zandalari Menace
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=57900, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Oh, raspberries! Just when we had saved the last bear cub from the treetops, the fires returned and scared them again!$b$bI don''t know if you know this, but baby bears are precious and soft.$B$BGo to the Whistling Grove, far to the northwest. Climb the trees, grab the bear cubs, and chuck them - gently! - to the soft target in the center of the grove.$B$B<Without warning, Mylune suddenly smashes you against her bosom and begins sobbing.>$B$BLil'' b-b-b-baby bears! Save them, $n!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29161; -- Those Bears Up There
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=57900, `Flags`=69760, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29164; -- Perfecting Your Howl
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=9300, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `QuestDescription`='Lady Sylvanas, leader of the Forsaken, is s''posed to be one of the best warriors in the Horde, maybe even as good as the warchief himself!$B$BI''ve always wanted to meet her, $n. Maybe an adventurer like you could get an audience with her! Would you take me to the Royal Quarter of the Undercity to meet Lady Sylvanas? It''s a long way away and I bet the guards would never let me in by myself!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29167; -- The Banshee Queen
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=6, `RewardBonusMoney`=96600, `Flags`=2097152, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29181 /*Druids of the Talon*/, 29214 /*The Shadow Wardens*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `Flags`=136, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Our invasion plan looks to have backfired. Several of our birds have already reported in, speaking of fires breaking out across the vales of central Hyjal.$b$bNow, many of our druids are stranded out in the field, unprepared for such a large-scale attack. Thisalee was near Ashen Lake, and several others were out in the Regrowth, to the northeast.$b$bGo, $n! Find them, and make sure that they do not succumb to this backdraft!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29197; -- Caught Unawares
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Flags`=136, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='We suffered heavy losses during the backdraft after our invasion attempt. Our second attempt cannot fail.$b$bWe need reinforcements before we attempt another invasion. Please, $n, work with Matoclaw to obtain enough resources to afford reinforcements. Then, we take our second and final stab at the Firelands.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29199; -- Calling for Reinforcements
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Before we depart, $n, I have another matter to which you should attend.$b$bA Druid of the Flame has been spotted in the ruins to the northwest. I suspect it is the same one that attacked us at the portal several days ago. Now would be an ideal time to see what it is that she truly wants... and if necessary, dispose of her.$b$bSee to this flame druid, then we can continue on our planned course.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29200; -- Leyara
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardXPDifficulty`=5, `RewardMoney`=94000, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `QuestDescription`='After we arrived, I dispatched my scouts to learn more about da Zandalari presence here in Zul''Aman. Many returned with useful information, but four still be missin''. If we do not act quickly, da new warlord''s lieutenants will offer dem as sacrifices in honor of da Zandalari emissaries.$B$BFind my scouts, $n, and free dem before da priests offer dem as sacrifices!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29217; -- The Captive Scouts
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `Flags`=5243016, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29245; -- The Mysterious Seed
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Having been burned so badly, Arch Druid Hamuul is suffering from edema - swelling of the body''s tissues. It takes a great deal of his attendants'' effort to keep his swelling down enough for him to breathe.$b$bNormally, to reduce this swelling, we make cuts in his flesh, but he is weak, $n. I cannot cut him today. I need your help.$b$bFlamewaker scales will aid with the swelling, but you need a lot of them.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29248; -- Releasing the Pressure
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=3, `RewardBonusMoney`=38700, `Flags`=5570696, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29249; -- Planting Season
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='Of all Ragnaros'' minions, the flamewakers appear to be the most devoted. Most of them dwell within this cave, preparing for another attack. Our foothold may be strong, but we will not tolerate any surprise attacks from these worms.$b$bNo, we will strike first.$b$bTear them apart, $n.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29264; -- Flamewakers of the Molten Flow
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `Flags`=20864, `FlagsEx`=64, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29266; -- DEPRECATED Zul'Gurub Voodoo (NYI)
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=6, `RewardBonusMoney`=96600, `Flags`=2097160, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29279 /*Filling the Moonwell*/, 29281 /*Additional Armaments*/, 29283 /*Calling the Ancients*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `ItemDropQuantity2`=1, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29295; -- The Bigger They Are
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=38700, `FlagsEx`=8, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29298; -- A Smoke-Stained Locket
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='I''ve been making progress in my research, $n. Based on what we''ve witnessed in the local flora, it''s quite possible that your Lasher also accepts superheated liquids as a principal source of nutrition.$B$BI''d like you to help me with a little experiment. The Emberspit Scorpions that inhabit the Magma Springs to the north spew out burning pools of fire during combat.$B$BTake the Lasher and observe his reaction to the scorpions'' Ember Pools.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29299; -- Some Like It Hot
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=38700, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='You were insightful to bring this locket to me, $n. I am among the few who know where Valstann''s body lays.$b$bYou can find his resting site in a small graveyard, southeast of Astranaar, in Ashenvale. Bring this locket to the site, and it may unlock more memories.$b$bFarewell, $n, and good luck on your journey.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29303; -- Tragedy and Family
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=8, `RewardBonusMoney`=77100, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29311; -- The Rest is History
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='My family has been making the best kimchi in Darnassus since the city was founded, $n. The secret is something simple, but it makes all the difference.$B$BWe bury the jars in the ground until it''s ready to serve and my latest batch has just reached that point. You can find the jars buried in earthen mounds all over the city. Would you help me gather them while the contents are just right?', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29313; -- The Secret to Perfect Kimchi
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `ItemDropQuantity1`=1, `ItemDropQuantity2`=1, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29314; -- Remembering the Ancestors
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardBonusMoney`=9300, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=33555378, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29315 /*Fungus Among Us*/, 29332 /*Lily, Oh Lily*/, 29333 /*Escargot A Go-Go*/, 29334 /*Roach Coach*/, 29364 /*Corn Mash*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29316 /*Back to Basics*/, 29318 /*Ribs for the Sentinels*/, 29351 /*A Round for the Guards*/, 29357 /*Spice Bread Aplenty*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='Have you met Sister Aquinne? She and I trained together in Dolanaar, and she recently came to the city to study at the Temple of the Moon. We decided to go for a boat ride, but the clumsy oarsman managed to capsize the craft!$B$BWhen we got back to the shore, Aquinne''s moon pendant was missing. The lakes in Darnassus are full of giant catfish who will gobble up anything shiny!$B$BI''ve been catching them nonstop, hoping to find the one with her pendant. I don''t suppose you want to help?', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29324; -- The Sister's Pendant
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=4, `RewardBonusMoney`=57900, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29326; -- The Nordrassil Summit
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=96600, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID` IN (29327 /*Elemental Bonds: Doubt*/, 29328 /*Elemental Bonds: Desire*/, 29329 /*Elemental Bonds: Patience*/);
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=115800, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `QuestDescription`='The totems, $n! We need to activate them, or Go''el is lost!$b$bKill the elementals next to each of my totems, located around the edges of this plateau. Once all four totems are activated, we should be able to free the last piece of Go''el''s soul!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29330; -- Elemental Bonds: Fury
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardBonusMoney`=38700, `Flags`=538968104, `AllowableRaces`=52430847, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29338; -- Into Unrelenting Flame
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='The best tastin'' fish live in the cold waters o'' Dun Morogh, $n, an'' don''t let anyone else tell ye otherwise! Me favorite, an'' the most popular one in Ironforge, is the arctic char, which only comes from our ancestral lands.$B$BI like tae think o'' it as Ironforge''s gift t'' the world!$B$BWhy don''t ye try yer hand at catchin'' a few yerself? The best place tae find ''em is down in Helm''s Bed Lake, in the eastern end o'' Dun Morogh.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29342; -- Cold Water Fishing
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='I''m sure by now ye''ve heard the tale o'' Old Ironjaw, the most famous and elusive fish in the waters o'' Ironforge''s Forlorn Cavern. Well, in his many years, he''s been responsible for the rise o'' many young ironjaws. Don''t let the name fool ye, $n, these young''uns are every bit as clever as their dad, but somewhat lackin'' in experience.$B$BWith skill an'' patience, ye could probably catch one, an'' when ye do, bring it to the museum in Ironforge''s Library an'' put it on display fer all to see!', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29343; -- One fer the Ages
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `ItemDropQuantity2`=1, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='Oh, no, $n, this is going to be a disaster if we don''t find some chicken soon... Ye just cannae make cock-a-leekie soup without the chicken! It''s not possible!$B$BThere''s still time to make the soup and broth if ye can find some fresh chicken. Will ye help me? There are usually a few chickens running around outside the front entrance to the city. If ye can get yer hands on, say, six o'' them, that should save me soup.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29352; -- A Fowl Shortage
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `ItemDropQuantity2`=1, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29353; -- Keepin' the Haggis Flowin'
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `QuestDescription`='It might seem like a basic thing, $n, but spice bread is a longtime favorite in Ironforge. Some days, I have trouble keeping up!$B$BWould ye like to cook some to practice yer skills an'' help meet the demand? Ye can buy all the ingredients ye''ll need from me brother, Emrul Riknussun, who is downstairs.', `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29355; -- Can't Get Enough Spice Bread
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoney`=75, `RewardMoneyDifficulty`=5, `ItemDropQuantity2`=1, `RewardSkillLineID`=0, `RewardNumSkillUps`=0, `RewardCurrencyID1`=81, `AllowableRaces`=18875469, `VerifiedBuild`=19034 WHERE `ID`=29356; -- I Need to Cask a Favor
